    "server": "new",
    "notes": "Clean-room request and response grammar from the private wave-2 ROM probes. Empty histories, best-per-identity ordering, dates, score conversion and structural blank slots are newly authored revival policy; no original server data or assets. M32 rating routes: getrate request builder 4000:F208 (body c=<id>&d=<pw>, both nonempty, id<=11 bytes at RAM 072A, pw<=13 bytes at RAM 0735) and response parser A000:2C24 (status c=1 required at RAM 0304, rating e=<value><2 digits> to RAM 0355/0357, games f=<digits> to RAM 0365; rating>=2500 takes the alternate display branch in A000:3866); setrate request builder 4000:F5DD (adds e=<0355><0357 zero-padded to 2>, f=<0365>, g=<0365-1>) and response parser A000:35AB (c=1 success, c=2 retry). Returned rating values are labelled placeholders; no original account or rating data."
  },
